    "title": "Warren to host first DORA bar crawl - NewsBreak",
    "text": "WARREN, Ohio (WKBN) — It’s been a year since Warren City Council approved Designated Outdoor Refreshment Areas of DORA’s, where alcohol can be consumed. On Saturday, Warren will host its first DORA. It’s the Christmas in July Bar Crawl. It starts at 6 p.m. Eight bars in downtown Warren will take part, all within a few blocks of the courthouse square. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WYTV.",
